"Node name for S&R":"DiffusersLoader"},"widgets_values":["ConceptGhost_SDXL_Base_1_0"]},{"id":6,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[-600,80],"size":[520,240],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":3}],"outputs":[{"name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[10],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"A2 — POSITIVE PROMPT (editable)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["Geometry-assist proxy for monocular 3D estimation. Preserve camera, framing, perspective, composition, silhouettes, positions, proportions, architecture, openings, and object layout. Improve geometric readability: clarify planes, occlusions, materials, contact shadows, depth separation, and distant elements. Reduce painterly ambiguity. Use neutral physically plausible lighting. Do not add details."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":7,"type":"CLIPTextEncode","pos":[-600,350],"size":[520,220],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":4}],"outputs":[{"name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[11],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"A3 — NEGATIVE PROMPT (editable)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPTextEncode"},"widgets_values":["changed camera, changed FOV, crop, fisheye, moved objects, changed proportions, warped architecture, added or removed objects, new openings, hallucinated details, extra clutter, cinematic relighting, fog, bloom, painterly abstraction, blurred boundaries, scene redesign, text, watermark"],"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":8,"type":"VAEEncode","pos":[-600,630],"size":[240,70],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"pixels","type":"IMAGE","link":5},{"name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":6}],"outputs":[{"name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[21],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"A4 — Encode source for Img2Img","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAEEncode"}},{"id":9,"type":"Note","pos":[-230,-80],"size":[420,650],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"title":"A — WHAT THESE SETTINGS DO","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note","text":""},"widgets_values":["COMPONENT 1 — SDXL / IMG2IMG\n\nPrompt: tells SDXL to reinterpret ONLY surface readability while preserving scene structure.\nKSampler defaults (visible later): Steps 24, CFG 4.0, Denoise 0.28.\n\nDenoise is the main 'how much may the image change?' control.\n• 0.18–0.22 = very conservative\n• 0.24–0.30 = balanced Geometry Assist\n• >0.30 = more reinterpretation / more hallucination risk\n\nCFG 4.0 keeps text guidance useful without forcing the prompt too aggressively."],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":10,"type":"Canny","pos":[300,260],"size":[300,110],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":7}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[9,12],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"B1 — Canny edges (≈ 100 / 200)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Canny"},"widgets_values":[0.392,0.784]},{"id":11,"type":"ControlNetLoader","pos":[300,80],"size":[340,90],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"outputs":[{"name":"CONTROL_NET","type":"CONTROL_NET","links":[8],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"B2 — SDXL Canny ControlNet","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ControlNetLoader"},"widgets_values":["ConceptGhost/diffusion_pytorch_model.fp16.safetensors"]},{"id":12,"type":"ControlNetApplyAdvanced","pos":[680,150],"size":[340,190],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":10},{"name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":11},{"name":"control_net","type":"CONTROL_NET","link":8},{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":9}],"outputs":[{"name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[19],"slot_index":0,"shape":3},{"name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[20],"slot_index":1,"shape":3}],"title":"B3 — Structure Lock: strength 0.80 / end 0.85","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ControlNetApplyAdvanced"},"widgets_values":[0.8,0.0,0.85]},{"id":13,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[300,420],"size":[320,330],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":12}],"title":"CONTROL HINT PREVIEW","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"}},{"id":14,"type":"Note","pos":[680,390],"size":[430,450],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"title":"B — WHAT THESE SETTINGS DO","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note","text":""},"widgets_values":["COMPONENT 2 — CONTROLNET / STRUCTURE\n\nCanny detects stable scene edges; the displayed thresholds 0.392 / 0.784 correspond approximately to 100 / 200 on an 8-bit 0–255 scale.\n\nControlNet strength = 0.80\n• Higher = stronger structural lock\n• Lower = more freedom for SDXL\n\nStart = 0.00, End = 0.85\nStructure is enforced through most of denoising, then the final 15% can refine surfaces.\n\nReference basis: Comfy-Org docs state 0.5–1.0 is typical and warn that values above ~0.8 can overcook when structure fights the prompt, so 0.80 is our balanced default."],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":15,"type":"IPAdapterModelLoader","pos":[300,-650],"size":[360,90],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"outputs":[{"name":"IPADAPTER","type":"IPADAPTER","links":[15],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"C1 — IP-Adapter SDXL ViT-H","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"IPAdapterModelLoader"},"widgets_values":["ConceptGhost/ip-adapter_sdxl_vit-h.safetensors"]},{"id":16,"type":"CLIPVisionLoader","pos":[300,-520],"size":[360,90],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"outputs":[{"name":"CLIP_VISION","type":"CLIP_VISION","links":[17],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"C2 — CLIP Vision ViT-H","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPVisionLoader"},"widgets_values":["ConceptGhost/model.safetensors"]},{"id":17,"type":"PrepImageForClipVision","pos":[300,-390],"size":[360,150],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":13}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[16],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"C3 — Prepare reference (PAD = no center crop)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PrepImageForClipVision"},"widgets_values":["LANCZOS","pad",0.0]},{"id":18,"type":"IPAdapterAdvanced","pos":[700,-620],"size":[360,300],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":14},{"name":"ipadapter","type":"IPADAPTER","link":15,"slot_index":1},{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":16},{"name":"image_negative","type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"name":"attn_mask","type":"MASK","link":null},{"name":"clip_vision","type":"CLIP_VISION","link":17,"slot_index":5}],"outputs":[{"name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[18],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"C4 — Reference Lock: weight 0.80 / end 0.75","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"IPAdapterAdvanced"},"widgets_values":[0.8,"linear","concat",0.0,0.75,"K+V"]},{"id":19,"type":"Note","pos":[1100,-650],"size":[430,470],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"title":"C — WHAT THESE SETTINGS DO","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note","text":""},"widgets_values":["COMPONENT 3 — IP-ADAPTER / REFERENCE LOCK\n\nWeight = 0.80 (official node docs call 0.8 a good linear starting point).\nWeight type = linear.\nStart = 0.00, End = 0.75.\nEmbeds scaling = K+V.\n\nThe reference image is prepared with PAD instead of center crop so the complete scene remains represented — important for environments.\n\nIP-Adapter keeps overall content/style tied to the source while ControlNet separately locks edges/structure."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":20,"type":"KSampler","pos":[1240,70],"size":[360,310],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":18},{"name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":19},{"name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":20},{"name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":21}],"outputs":[{"name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[22],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"D1 — RUN HERE: Steps 24 / CFG 4 / Denoise 0.28","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"KSampler"},"widgets_values":[1701,"fixed",24,4.0,"euler","normal",0.28]},{"id":21,"type":"VAEDecode","pos":[1660,120],"size":[240,80],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":22},{"name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":23}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[24,25],"slot_index":0,"shape":3}],"title":"D2 — Decode proxy","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAEDecode"}},{"id":22,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[1960,-20],"size":[430,430],"flags":{},"order":18,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":24}],"title":"GEOMETRY ASSIST RESULT","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"}},{"id":23,"type":"SaveImage","pos":[1960,450],"size":[430,420],"flags":{},"order":19,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":25}],"title":"SAVE RESULT","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"SaveImage"},"widgets_values":["ConceptGhost/GeometryAssist"]},{"id":24,"type":"Note","pos":[1240,430],"size":[650,420],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"title":"D — TUNING & ANTI-STALL NOTES","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Note","text":""},"widgets_values":["TUNING / STALL DIAGNOSTIC\n\nIf output changes too little: raise Denoise toward 0.30.\nIf structure drifts: lower Denoise or raise ControlNet toward 0.90.\nIf source identity/composition weakens: raise IP-Adapter slightly (0.85–0.90).\nIf image becomes overcooked: lower ControlNet/IP-Adapter or Denoise.\n\nIf progress appears stuck, ComfyUI will show the active node. First reduce Steps 24→16. If it still stalls, temporarily bypass IPAdapterAdvanced; this separates sampler/ControlNet issues from IP-Adapter issues."],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"}],"links":[[1,1,0,2,0,"IMAGE"],[2,2,0,3,0,"IMAGE"],[3,5,1,6,0,"CLIP"],[4,5,1,7,0,"CLIP"],[5,2,0,8,0,"IMAGE"],[6,5,2,8,1,"VAE"],[7,2,0,10,0,"IMAGE"],[8,11,0,12,2,"CONTROL_NET"],[9,10,0,12,3,"IMAGE"],[10,6,0,12,0,"CONDITIONING"],[11,7,0,12,1,"CONDITIONING"],[12,10,0,13,0,"IMAGE"],[13,2,0,17,0,"IMAGE"],[14,5,0,18,0,"MODEL"],[15,15,0,18,1,"IPADAPTER"],[16,17,0,18,2,"IMAGE"],[17,16,0,18,5,"CLIP_VISION"],[18,18,0,20,0,"MODEL"],[19,12,0,20,1,"COND